<title>SPAIN: Nordlb issues 10 bln pta five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Nordlb issues 10 bln pta five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norddeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale is issuing a 10 billion peseta five-year matador bond, carrying a six percent coupon at 101.09, the lead manager Argentaria said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bond will mature on March 9, 2002, with a pay date of March 9, 1997. Total fees are 1.625 percent for management and underwriting. Denominations are 100,000 pesetas.</p>
<p>The bond is rated AA1 by Moody's.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
